<view class="pill">收口 · 不是拉低顶，而是抬共通值</view>

<view class="card">
  <view class="card-h3">缩小差距有三条路，共创论走第三条</view>
  <view class="muted">传统左右之争困在前两条，事现鉴让你直接"上来"。</view>
  <view class="path-row">
    <view class="path-col path-old">
      <view class="path-t">涓滴 / 再分配</view>
      <view class="path-bar" style="background:#c41e3a">顶部</view>
      <view class="path-bar" style="background:#d4a017">你</view>
      <view class="path-d">漏到一半就停了</view>
      <view class="path-d">差距仍在</view>
    </view>
    <view class="path-col path-old2">
      <view class="path-t">均平 / 拉平</view>
      <view class="path-bar" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c41e3a,#d4a017)">大家都压到这里</view>
      <view class="path-d">失去激励</view>
      <view class="path-d">效率下降</view>
    </view>
    <view class="path-col path-key">
